   "notation": "--ds-blanket-selected",
   "definition": "Use as a translucent blanket to communicate selection when changing the background of the selected content is not possible, such as selected Editor blocks. The content beneath remains visible. Do not use to indicate keyboard focus or hover alone."
  },
